## Re-fetching

To re-fetch and verify SHAs match this record:

    curl -fsSL --max-time 30 -o /tmp/CornellBox.zip \
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jvm-graphics-labs/awesome-3d-meshes/master/McGuire/Cornell%20Box/CornellBox.zip"
    sha256sum /tmp/CornellBox.zip  # expect cf5eb590...
    unzip /tmp/CornellBox.zip CornellBox-Original.obj CornellBox-Original.mtl -d /tmp/
    sha256sum /tmp/CornellBox-Original.obj   # expect 6e2b8b91...
    sha256sum /tmp/CornellBox-Original.mtl   # expect 1f687df1...

If any SHA differs, the upstream has been updated since 2026-07-03
and the project must re-validate. The expectation per upstream
stability is that these files have been stable since 2012-01-17
(the OBJ's mtime in the upstream zip).
